	</header>


	<!-- SECTION 1: MANIFEST -->
	<section id="manifest">
		<h2>01_MANIFEST</h2>
		<fieldset>
			<legend>OPERATOR_MANIFEST.md</legend>
			<p>
				Hi! I'm Alfie, a Computer Science student at Lancaster University. My technical foundation is built on Python, Java, and C/C++, with a strong interest in software engineering and cybersecurity.</p>
				I try to be an active contributor to open-source software. I enjoy contributing to the software I enjoy using, and apply what I learn in order to write maintainable and well documented code.<br>
				I contribute to Wikipedia by creating and refining articles about the British railway network, with a focus on the sometimes forgotten, and often poorly documented, closed regional branch line network.<br>
				I am currently developing a web-based open-source interactive map of the UK rail network, starting in Lancashire, (React/deck.gl), exploring how best to visualise the network, and to use the incredible resource of OpenStreetMap to increase the quality of available railway maps.<br>
			<p>
				I believe in the power of open information. Whether it's through code or historical articles, I aim to build tools and documentation that help preserve the history of the UK's railway infrastructure.</p>
		</fieldset>
		<fieldset class="mono">
			<legend>> tail -f /var/log/now</legend>
			<div style="line-height: 1.8;">
				<!-- Replace the hardcoded timestamp with the Astro variable -->
				<span style="color: var(--blueprint-blue);">{dynamicTimestamp}</span><br>
				> <strong>[LOAD]</strong> Revising for end-of-year CS exams.<br>
				> <strong>[BUILD]</strong> Compiling this zero-JS Astro portfolio.<br>
				> <strong>[READ]</strong> <i>The Great Dune Trilogy</i> by Frank Herbert.<br>
				> <strong>[GEAR]</strong> An old Dell Optiplex system for use as a personal server.
			</div>
		</fieldset>
	</section>

	<section id="status-board">
		<h2>01.5_CIS_DISPLAY</h2>
