					&gt; DESC: Stark blueprint-esque portfolio utilising semantic, high-performance static rendering.<br>
					&gt; REPO: <a href="https://github.com/Alfie-sci/portfolio-website">github.com/Alfie-sci/portfolio-website</a><br>
