					<span class="hex-bytes">48 6f 6d 65 6c 61 62 00</span>
					<span class="hex-ascii">Homelab</span>
					<span class="hex-status status-active">[ONLINE]</span>
				</summary>
				<div class="project-details">
					<strong>[ADDR_SECTOR_0x0020: OPTIPLEX_HOMELAB_NODE]</strong><br>
					&gt; DESC: Self-hosting pipeline repurposed from a legacy Dell Optiplex system to run local, secure, isolated network storage for my important university work and iCloud photos.<br>
					&gt; INFRA: Proxmox VE hypervisor // Samba File Storage // Docker containerisation.<br>
				</div>
			</details>
			<!-- Row 3: Bakewell Railway -->
			<details class="hex-row">
				<summary class="hex-summary">
					<span class="hex-addr">0x0020</span>
					<span class="hex-bytes">42 61 6b 65 77 65 6c 6c</span>
					<span class="hex-ascii">Bakewell Rwy Tlne</span>
